  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound ripe peaches - peeled, pitted, and chopped",
    "2 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "0.5 cup water",
    "0.5 cup white sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SbOhLbVjTTrza0N7UBceYdbt1Qo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267581-peach-sorbet-VAT-005-step-01-0c242f5530654de082c39275d98e2d4b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267581/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend peaches in a blender until smooth. Measure out 1 ½ cups peach purée into a medium bowl. Stir in lemon juice immediately and refrigerate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ypC9vxVdNts5a0OJprOCzblHLPE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267581-peach-sorbet-VAT-006-step-02-9f61d050627c4fd7823f37626aaa6129.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267581/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine water and sugar in a small saucepan and bring to a boil. Stir until sugar is dissolved, about 1 minute. Remove simple syrup from heat and let cool to room temperature, then refrigerate until chilled, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9fWVy0Rd4KWDWNmMcuzeyACcK0U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267581-peach-sorbet-VAT-007-step-03-e123a007473d4461969eaf056351dfe3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267581/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour chilled peach purée and simple syrup into an ice cream maker and freeze according to the manufacturer's instructions, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FtvJhWRaoqN6CVapbbNsWQ7LKgk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267581-peach-sorbet-VAT-008-step-04-8f7d8eec76a54a1e9fdadeca46d2f90b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267581/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to an airtight container and freeze until firm, about 4 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QNfImPKQR8NwQhlyJoVEkiMf7eY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267581-peach-sorbet-VAT-009-step-05-4d7f4f72dd5e4a0f823c5c5f4b78804b.jpg"
      ],
